# T9 -- v6.1 irruptions on CTRL: with the module ON and every cavern's pressure PINNED at the threshold (the way E23 pinned irritation — there is no headless way to send dwarves into a cavern, so the pressure path is exercised by the pin and the ARMING path by DF's own cavern arrivals), does the next arriving cavern group the roster admits get armed, held armed, and stood down; with the module OFF under the same pin, nothing. A season each, two replicates, the T8 roster with the cavern layer on and the cavern gate on (max 2). Samples every 3,000 ticks: cavern units, how many carry the agitated flag, citizens, the armed group, the three pressures, and the ledger's irruption lines. The fort may lose dwarves in the ON arm — that is a result.
